<title>USA: Fed buys coupons maturing 11/15/97 to 4/30/99.</title>
<headline>Fed buys coupons maturing 11/15/97 to 4/30/99.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve confirmed it was buying coupon securities maturing November 15, 1997 through April 30, 1999 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660))</p>
